{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfyhEE69v9kmx9rz3iNYs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[x] `npm test`, `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` and `cargo test` in `src-tauri` all pass\n\nAll seven checklist items are done and committed. The launch error banner should now be gone: the stubs that threw at startup are replaced, startup's `Promise.all` now resolves, and the UI tells the host it is ready. I checked this with tests only; I didn't launch the app.\n\n1. `onLog` and `onError` now subscribe to the host's `log` and `error` events, the same way `onDispatch` does. They pass the host's array through as separate arguments, support `{ once: true }`, and return an unsubscribe function. Each has three shim tests, and I saw them fail before the code existed.\n2. Both are out of the stub register. That also removed the comment naming `src-tauri/src/log.rs`, which doesn't exist. Ticket 01 had already cut the US-065 comment down to the two open dialogs.\n3. The new test in `test/unit/renderer-boots.js` runs the built renderer with the host answering just enough: its paths, a saved profile, and listener registrations. It checks that `ipc_ready` is sent, and only after the `log`, `error` and `dispatch` listeners register. With the old stubbed shim built, it fails on exactly those checks.\n\nOne thing you might not expect: the boot test needed the fake webview to have a bit more DOM so React could render, plus `TextDecoder`. Without `TextDecoder`, the saved profile quietly reads as missing. The three existing boot tests still pass with these additions.\n\nFinal gate: `npm test` exited 0 with 4220/4220 passing. `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` and `cargo test` (209 tests) also pass; this ticket changed no Rust code. I added a short note to `test/AGENTS.md` on how to answer enough of the host to boot the bundle. My notes are in `.nightralph/notes.md`, uncommitted as instructed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":628,"cache_read_input_tokens":85724,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":628},"output_tokens":664,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10e52fa7-0731-4e0f-9efd-cb735ba1e975","uuid":"c1134f45-16e0-42c6-85b1-eeb7dcf7cf0a","timestamp":"2026-10-13T05:36:20.455Z","request_id":"req_011CfyhEDoYZfEiWi9NHxLR8"}
